    "char_start": 4876,
    "end": 322.844,
    "sent_id": "t0034.s01",
    "start": 320.535,
    "text": "Where does it stop working?",
    "unit_id": "t0034.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5003,
    "char_start": 4904,
    "end": 329.508,
    "sent_id": "t0035.s01",
    "start": 322.844,
    "text": "Outside of the tools available at the RockShox level, the error mode is more difficult to identify.",
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5068,
    "char_start": 5004,
    "end": 333.816,
    "sent_id": "t0035.s02",
    "start": 329.508,
    "text": "Once you understand that, the remaining decisions become easier.",
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5157,
    "char_start": 5069,
    "end": 338.715,
    "sent_id": "t0036.s01",
    "start": 333.816,
    "text": "Let's change the subject – I would like to dedicate the next section to land management.",
    "unit_id": "t0036.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5300,
    "char_start": 5158,
    "end": 346.489,
    "sent_id": "t0037.s01",
    "start": 338.715,
    "text": "That's where the conversation becomes interesting, because the considerations surrounding land management permeate everything we've discussed.",
    "unit_id": "t0037.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5338,
    "char_start": 5301,
    "end": 348.752,
    "sent_id": "t0038.s01",
    "start": 346.489,
    "text": "I would like to explore this further.",
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5412,
    "char_start": 5339,
    "end": 353.218,
    "sent_id": "t0038.s02",
    "start": 348.752,
    "text": "What is the opposing perspective that most listeners are unable to grasp?",
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5542,
    "char_start": 5413,
    "end": 360.787,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s01",
    "start": 353.218,
    "text": "Ultimately, the suspension setup is the design choice that has the biggest impact on performance, regardless of the riding style.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5588,
    "char_start": 5543,
    "end": 363.428,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s02",
    "start": 360.787,
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that use RockShox.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5678,
    "char_start": 5589,
    "end": 368.65,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s03",
    "start": 363.428,
    "text": "If you ignore this, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5716,
    "char_start": 5679,
    "end": 370.908,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s01",
    "start": 368.65,
    "text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5777,
    "char_start": 5717,
    "end": 374.569,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s02",
    "start": 370.908,
    "text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of road construction?",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5878,
    "char_start": 5778,
    "end": 380.103,
    "sent_id": "t0041.s01",
    "start": 374.569,
    "text": "To be honest, the most common mistake made by new path builders is digging with too much of a slope.",
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5975,
    "char_start": 5879,
    "end": 385.415,
    "sent_id": "t0041.s02",
    "start": 380.103,
    "text": "The framework is important because it tells you what considerations you are taking into account.",
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6049,
    "char_start": 5976,
    "end": 390.993,
    "sent_id": "t0042.s01",
    "start": 385.415,
    "text": "Before we wrap up, what's one thing that listeners can try out this week?",
    "unit_id": "t0042.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6118,
    "char_start": 6050,
    "end": 396.398,
    "sent_id": "t0043.s01",
    "start": 390.993,
    "text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6141,
    "char_start": 6119,
    "end": 398.147,
    "sent_id": "t0043.s02",
    "start": 396.398,
    "text": "The rest is iteration.",
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6197,
    "char_start": 6142,
    "end": 403.121,
    "sent_id": "t0044.s01",
    "start": 398.147,
    "text": "And finally, a big thank you to our partners at Linear.",
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6271,
    "char_start": 6198,
    "end": 409.723,
    "sent_id": "t0044.s02",
    "start": 403.121,
    "text": "Linear is the issue tracker, built for speed – designed for keyboard use.",
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6289,
    "char_start": 6272,
    "end": 411.261,
    "sent_id": "t0044.s03",
    "start": 409.723,
    "text": "Visit linear.com.",
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6336,
    "char_start": 6290,
    "end": 414.014,
    "sent_id": "t0044.s04",
